Dear BaSTA users,

Our paper on the BaSTA package has recently been accepted for publication at Methods in Ecology and Evolution (http://methodsblog.wordpress.com/2012/01/17/recently-accepted-articles-8/).

The full title is "BaSTA: an R package for Bayesian estimation of age-specific survival from incomplete mark-recapture/recovery data with covariates" with the authors Fernando Colchero, Owen Jones and Maren Rebke.

We expect the article to be available online within the next 2 weeks. I'll send a link to the finished product as soon as I get it.

Best wishes,

Owen


