Dear BaSTA Users,

Our paper on the BaSTA package is now published in Methods in Ecology and Evolution:

http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/j.2041-210X.2012.00186.x/abstract

In addition, we have just uploaded the latest version (v. 1.1) of the package to the CRAN repository in Vienna. This can be installed from source *now* and will be available as binaries for Windows etc. tomorrow. It should also propagate to the various CRAN mirrors in the next few hours.

install.packages("BaSTA",type="source",repos="http://cran.at.r-project.org/")

As ever, please let us know if you find any bugs, or need assistance with the using the package.

Best wishes,

Owen (and the BaSTA team)

